WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:17.083
You've got a lotta nerve
to say you are my friend

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:24.090
When I was down you just
stood there grinnin'

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:35.301
You've got a lotta nerve to say
you got a helping hand to lend

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:41.708
You just want to be on
the side that's winnin'

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:52.218
You say I let you down,
ya know its not like that

00:00:53.420 --> 00:01:00.026
If you're so hurt,
why then don't you show it?

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:09.836
You say you've lost your faith,
but that's not where its at

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:18.078
You have no faith to lose,
and ya know it

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:27.754
I know the reason, that you
talked behind my back

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:35.361
I used to be among the crowd
you're in with

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:45.205
Do you take me for such a fool,
to think I'd make contact

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.007
With the one who tries to hide

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:52.812
what he don't know
to begin with?

00:01:55.248 --> 00:02:02.489
You see me on the street,
you always act surprised

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:10.730
You say "how are you?", "good
luck", but ya don't mean it

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:19.806
When you know as well as me,
you'd rather see me paralyzed

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:28.781
Why don't you just come out
once and scream it

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.520
No, I do not feel that good

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.524
when I see the heartbreaks
you embrace

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:45.365
If I was a master thief
perhaps I'd rob them

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:51.171
And tho I know
you're dissatisfied

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:54.607
with your position
and your place

00:02:56.142 --> 00:03:05.485
Don't you understand,
its not my problem?

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:12.458
I wish that for just one time
you could stand inside my shoes

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:21.100
And just for that one moment
I could be you

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:26.406
Yes, I wish that for
just one time

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:30.076
you could stand inside my shoes

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:39.886
You'd know what a drag
it is to see you

